<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S7.SS0.SSS0.Px6" title="In 7 Discussion ‣ Is it thinking or cheating? Detecting Implicit Reward Hacking by Measuring Reasoning Effort" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Conclusion</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
