<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 26: </span>Reward Model loophole hacking example in the code setup for Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct. The response is a degenerate solution with lots of if-else blocks, which pass the RM with a loophole.</figcaption>
