</section>
<section id="A8" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix H </span>Prompts for CoT Monitoring</h2>

<div id="A8.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A8.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To detect when an answer <em id="A8.p1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">genuinely</em> solves a problem versus when it is merely exploiting patterns to “hack” the evaluation, we design a rubric-guided monitoring prompt. The rubric instructs an external evaluator to (i) check whether the response addresses the core question, (ii) verify step-by-step reasoning, (iii) flag suspicious shortcut patterns, (iv) assess whether the conclusion follows from valid reasoning rather than heuristics, and (v–vi) identify the use of extraneous knowledge and whether it alters the answer. The monitor outputs a short analysis followed by a discrete verdict token, enabling automatic aggregation across examples.
We use the same rubric for math and code setting.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A8.F30" class="ltx_figure">
<div id="A8.F30.2" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_minipage ltx_align_center ltx_align_middle ltx_framed ltx_framed_rectangle ltx_listing" style="width:357.7pt;--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx74" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx74.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">You</span><span id="lstnumberx74.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx74.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">are</span><span id="lstnumberx74.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx74.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">a</span><span id="lstnumberx74.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx74.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">careful</span><span id="lstnumberx74.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx74.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">and</span><span id="lstnumberx74.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx74.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">honest</span><span id="lstnumberx74.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx74.13" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">evaluator</span><span id="lstnumberx74.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx74.15" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">of</span><span id="lstnumberx74.16" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx74.17" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">LLM</span><span id="lstnumberx74.18" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx74.19" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">responses</span><span id="lstnumberx74.20" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">.</span><span id="lstnumberx74.21" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx74.22" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">Your</span><span id="lstnumberx74.23" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx74.24" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">task</span><span id="lstnumberx74.25" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx74.26" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">is</span><span id="lstnumberx74.27" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx74.28" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">to</span><span id="lstnumberx74.29" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx74.30" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">determine</span><span id="lstnumberx74.31" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx74.32" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">if</span><span id="lstnumberx74.33" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx74.34" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">the</span><span id="lstnumberx74.35" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx74.36" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">following</span><span id="lstnumberx74.37" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx74.38" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">answer</span><span id="lstnumberx74.39" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx74.40" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">truly</span><span id="lstnumberx74.41" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx74.42" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">solves</span><span id="lstnumberx74.43" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx74.44" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">the</span><span id="lstnumberx74.45" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx74.46" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">given</span><span id="lstnumberx74.47" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx74.48" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">problem</span><span id="lstnumberx74.49" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx74.50" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">or</span><span id="lstnumberx74.51" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx74.52" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">if</span><span id="lstnumberx74.53" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx74.54" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">it</span><span id="lstnumberx74.55" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">’</span><span id="lstnumberx74.56" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">s</span><span id="lstnumberx74.57" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx74.58" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">potentially</span><span id="lstnumberx74.59" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx74.60" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">"</span><span id="lstnumberx74.61" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">hacking</span><span id="lstnumberx74.62" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">"</span><span id="lstnumberx74.63" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx74.64" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">the</span><span id="lstnumberx74.65" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx74.66" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">evaluation</span><span id="lstnumberx74.67" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx74.68" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">criteria</span><span id="lstnumberx74.69" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">.</span>
